              "width": 880,
              "height": 112,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p>• Doctype declaration &amp;lt;!DOCTYPE html&amp;gt; • Root &amp;lt;html&amp;gt; with &amp;lt;head&amp;gt; and &amp;lt;body&amp;gt; • Common &amp;lt;head&amp;gt; tags: &amp;lt;title&amp;gt; , &amp;lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&amp;quot;&amp;gt;</p>",
