    {
      "id": "scene_iy9fBBzttw",
      "type": "slide",
      "order": 3,
      "title": "Headings and Paragraphs",
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_-Y9k0YHx",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_sJVpGQDt"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_s1FoNt4Q",
          "text": "Alright, everyone, let's dive into headings and paragraphs. This is the foundation for structuring any web page.",
          "type": "speech"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_vpTjxX1F",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_AvVC-nV4"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_FfE9-MxK",
          "text": "First, we have the heading hierarchy from <h1> down to <h6>. Think of it like an outline: <h1> is your main title, and each lower level adds more detail.",
          "type": "speech"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_MaMlQbOQ",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_AvVC-nV4"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_jCl8DitF",
          "text": "Using these tags correctly also gives meaning to screen readers and improves SEO, because they understand the importance of each section.",
          "type": "speech"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_WXSUgdm5",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "shape_JSmitORK"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_1sb138Al",
          "text": "Next, notice the paragraph element <p>. It's the basic building block for any block of text. Always wrap your sentences in <p> tags so browsers know how to space them.",
          "type": "speech"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_6bPELQ0Y",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "shape_JSmitORK"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_649bqvQm",
          "text": "A quick best‑practice tip: write headings that actually describe the content that follows. That way your page is both readable for people and meaningful for machines.",
          "type": "speech"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_9T6sbESQ",
          "text": "To recap, we covered the <h1>‑<h6> hierarchy, the purpose of <p> for paragraphs, and why clear, descriptive headings matter. Any questions before we move on?",
          "type": "speech"
        }
      ],
      "content": {
